      "content": "Yeah, the transition is pretty firm. The compliance team specifically flagged your current neural-probabilistic modeling as a liability because it's a \"black box.\" They want to move away from anything that can't be traced back to a specific line of if-then logic. So, once the new rule-based engine is live, your current inference engine will be decommissioned to make room.",
